  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Scaling up of the Energy &amp; Environment Partnership with Southern &amp; East Africa - Implementation Phase is a component of Scaling up of the Energy and Environment Partnership with Southern and East Africa reported by FCDO with a funding type of 112 - Other bilateral donor and a budget of &#xa3;26,800,000. This project benefits Africa, regional. It works in the following sector(s): Environmental policy and administrative management, Electric power transmission and distribution (centralised grids).</narrative>
